              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "درگذشتن (dargozashtan) — \"to pass away\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مادربزرگم سال گذشته درگذشت. Mâdarbozorgam sâl-e gozashte dargozasht. My grandmother passed away last year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Respectful. Present stem gozar-: dar migozarad. The noun is dargozasht \"a passing\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "dargozashtan is the native verb gozashtan \"to pass\" with the prefix dar: to pass on. EtymDB lists no entry."
            }
          ]
        },
