              "text": "دفن کردن (dafn kardan) — \"to bury\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او را در روستای خودش دفن کردند. U râ dar rustâ-ye khodash dafn kardand. They buried him in his own village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present dafn mikonad; the passive is dafn shod."
            }
          ]
