          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "dafn is borrowed from Arabic dafn, \"burial\" (EtymDB lists the Arabic word). kardan \"to do\" is inherited Persian."
