              "text": "هر پنجشنبه سر قبر پدرش میرفت. Har panjshanbe sar-e qabr-e pedarash miraft. Every Thursday he used to go to his father's grave."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Broken plural qobur. Thursday is the usual day for visiting graves."
